01:01:07.480 --> 01:01:25.730
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. I know what you're asking-- is the secret to his vast success a combination of deception, cunning, suavish good looks, rock hard abs, millions of dollars that he stole from a Federal Reserve armored car, Brylcreem, and the ability to change into a tiny little mouse and crawl into any space at will? Is it?
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生。我知道你在问什么——他巨大成功的秘诀是欺骗、狡猾、风度翩翩、摇滚硬汉腹肌、他从联邦储备局装甲车上偷来的数百万美元、发蜡，以及能随意变成一只小老鼠并爬进任何空间的能力的组合吗？是吗？

01:01:25.730 --> 01:01:29.110
<v Mary Wingerd>Well, I'm not going to say that. But, yes, it is.
<v Mary Wingerd>好吧，我不会这么说。但，是的，确实是。

01:01:29.110 --> 01:01:34.110
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周再见，会有更多《美国生活》的故事。
